{"hw":"ψηφόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ψηφόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ψηφ-όω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">adorn with gems,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τοὺς πόδας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lyd.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mag.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.4</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mens.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.26</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">work in mosaic,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Supp.Epigr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.993</span> </span> (Arabia, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>); <b class=\"lex-tr\">adorn with mosaics,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τὸ θυσιαστήριον Ἀρχ. Δελτ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.27</span> </span> (Lesbos).</div></div>"}